            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>All cancers have psychological and social repercussions which can impact on the patient's sexual quality of life. While the subject is still taboo, support care, which involves different professionals working together, is increasingly offering patients the opportunity to talk and become informed about these issues.</AbstractText>
